<title>LUXEMBOURG: No accord today on EMU budget pact.</title>
<headline>No accord today on EMU budget pact.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will not be able to agree today on final details of a stability pact aimed at ensuring spending discipline among countries inside monetary union, an EU diplomat said on Monday.</p>
<p>French Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn later confirmed there had been no agreement.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
